_:n3adebb2a611d4173acd5996b8c5a64f7b848 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "If a wall has a representative volume element which has a pattern which has dominant pattern entities (hollow bricks) that have a pergentage of volume less than 30% then the value of MQI Unit Properties is equal to ‘0.3’ for vertical loads, ‘0.5’ for out of plane loads and ‘0.3’ for in plane loads." .
_:n3adebb2a611d4173acd5996b8c5a64f7b736 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "If a wall has a representative volume element which has a pattern which has dominant pattern entities ‘rubble stones’, and dominant pattern entities ‘dry joints’, then the value of MQI Unit Shape is equal to ‘0’ for vertical loads, ‘0’ for out of plane loads and ‘0’ for in plane loads." .
